        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 500;">Música del Pacífico Colombiano</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: rgba(246,241,232,.8); line-height: 1.5;">Marimba de chonta, currulao, alabaos y salsa para conectar con la vibra de la costa.</p>
        
        <div style="width: 100%; margin-top: 15px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
          <iframe style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/37i9dQZF1DXcBWIGoYBM5M?utm_source=generator" width="100%" height="352" frameBorder="0" allowfullscreen="" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
        </div>
